"P2669520925" "Paula Dempsey has been asking to work with you, {HeroName}. She's been working on a few inventions, but most of her work has been focusing on <color red>The Clockwork</color>. She's a smart woman, but the Clockwork are proving to be anything but cooperative in her investigations. She could really use your help in figuring out what the Clockwork are up to here in Kings Row."
