// Page SCIENCE Text :
"P1422478961" "Samuel Pierce is an event coordinator here in Kings Row. He's organized several demonstrations to point out economical and social predation by big businesses on the innocent. Lately, however, he's been focusing on protecting the innocent from a different kind of predator: <color red>The Vahzilok</color>. He could really use a hero of your caliber to help take these monsters down."
// Answer Text :
"P3671871422" "Accept Samuel Pierce as a new contact"
// Page ScienceContact Text :
"P2424333887" "You and Sam are going to do a lot of good for this city, {HeroName}. A lot of good."
// Page Natural Text :
"P2483205201" "You've met Vic Johannson already, right {HeroName}?<br><br>Vic is good people and a rocksteady cop on one of the meanest beats in Paragon City. He could really use your help in dealing with <color red>The Lost</color>."
// Answer Text :
"P3111449728" "Accept Vic Johansson as a new contact"
// Page NaturalContact Text :
"P2900451859" "You and Vic are going to do a lot of good for this city, {HeroName}. A lot of good."
// Page Mutant Text :
"P4037729675" "Ron Hughes is a science reporter who has come to Kings Row to work on stories around the Skulls and their Superadine drug ring. He's really impressed with what you've done to take the Skulls down a notch and would love to work with you."
// Answer Text :
"P2076913171" "Accept Ron Hughes as a new contact"
// Page MutantContact Text :
"P117722316" "You and Ron are going to do a lot of good for this city, {HeroName}. A lot of good."
